{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14545","headline":"暮春感怀 二 · 戴叔伦","name":"暮春感怀 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四十无闻嬾慢身，放情丘壑任天真。\n悠悠往事杯中物，赫赫时名扇外尘。\n短策看云松寺晚，疎帘听雨草堂春。\n山花水鸟皆知己，百遍相过不厌贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}